                  "label": "when eyelid margin lesions are centrally located, away from the lateral canthus or lacrimal punctum"
                },
                {
                  "label": "histologic monitoring of tumor borders to ensure complete excision is mandatory",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "label": "borders of excisional biopsy should be marked"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "if margins are positive, involved area should be reexcised",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "label": "surgeon must always be prepared to do a much larger reconstruction than originally anticipated"
